{"unit_id":"nuet9__dsh-session-categories#card-zh","repo":"nuet9/dsh-session-categories","commit":"a24066874acd042519f69bb900a1fdf60c767b6c","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@local/session-categories（DSH 网页插件）：为 Harness 工作区提供持久的会话分类侧栏。它在侧栏工作区槽位显示分类视图，并以 Host 存储保存各工作区的分类和会话归属。主要功能包括创建、重命名和删除分类，将会话移动到分类或未分类，按拖放顺序整理会话，以及集中查看运行中、待交互和未读完成状态。适合需要在多个工作区中整理会话的 Harness 用户。使用前需要 Harness 工作区与 Host 存储服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:121-165","index.js:7-18","model.js:73-117"]}
{"unit_id":"nuet9__dsh-session-categories#card-en","repo":"nuet9/dsh-session-categories","commit":"a24066874acd042519f69bb900a1fdf60c767b6c","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@local/session-categories adds persistent categories to Harness workspace sessions. Its sidebar supports category creation, renaming, deletion, session moves and ordering, plus running and unread status. Data uses Host storage; Harness retains session membership.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:121-165","index.js:7-18","model.js:73-117"]}
